# Scale Up: "target creature you control becomes a green Wurm with base power and toughness 6/4". Setting a creature type
# replaces every creature type the creature had (CR 205.1a) and setting its color replaces the colors it had (CR 105.3,
# 613.1e): Mother of Runes, a white Human Cleric 1/1, is a green Wurm 6/4 and no longer a Human or a Cleric. It is still a
# creature, and the effect ends at the cleanup step (CR 514.2): on the opponent's next turn it is the white 1/1 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mother of Runes
Scale Up
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mother of Runes.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Scale Up.Cast(Mother of Runes)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Subtypes = Wurm
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Colors = Green
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Types = Creature
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Power = 6
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Toughness = 4
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Subtypes = Cleric; Human
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Colors = White
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mother of Runes.Toughness = 1
